artifacts/
dist/
dist-*/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/build/
codecs/*.dll
native/third_party/
tools/benchmark_corpus/
tools/benchmark_references/
tools/bench-507/.out/
docs/screenshots/
**/TestResults/
**/__pycache__/
*.zip
*.pdb
build-output*.txt
